      en: ["Founded in 1890, it is one of the oldest active industrial sites in Nicaragua.", "Part of the Pellas Group, one of Central America's largest economic entities.", "The mill produces over 5 million quintals of sugar per harvest season.", "Provides the essential molasses for the world-renowned 'Flor de Caña' rum.", "Generates approximately 60 megawatts of green energy for the national grid.", "Maintains a dedicated clinic for the treatment of chronic kidney disease (CKDnT)."],
