      en: ["Acquired in 1998 by the Guatemala-based Pantaleon Group.", "Processes up to 12,000 tons of sugarcane daily during the harvest season.", "One of the largest producers of biomass-derived electricity in Nicaragua.", "Holds international Bonsucro certification for sustainable sugar production.", "Employs over 6,000 people directly and indirectly during peak periods.", "A key supplier for the regional food and beverage manufacturing industries."],
