      en: ["Commenced operations in 1964 in the Jinotega department.", "Utilizes water from the artificially created Apanás Reservoir.", "The first major hydroelectric plant in Nicaragua's history.", "Equipped with two Francis turbines for power generation.", "Total installed capacity is approximately 50 megawatts.", "Underwent a comprehensive modernization between 2012 and 2015."],
